    "plain_text": "Miles Davis is an American maritime preservationist who served as commodore of a Northern California association for historic craft. He became active in Bay Area heritage during the 1990s. His long-term stewardship of a significant prewar motor vessel helped preserve it through years spent around San Francisco, the Delta, Oakland and Richmond.",
